<title>UK: Russia Tatneft overallotment exercised.</title>
<headline>Russia Tatneft overallotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 15 overallotment option for an American Depositary Share offering for AO Tatneft, an oil producer based in the Russian republic of Tatarstan has been exercised, the oil company said in a statement.</p>
<p>An additional 348,930 ADS have been issued and the total offer is for 2.675 million ADS.</p>
<p>The offering, which was lead managerd by Dresdner Kleinwort Benson was originally priced at $45.00, with each ADS equivalent to one underlying share. The Tatneft ADS closed at $47.25/$48.25 on Friday in London. -- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
</text>
